From the top.

515
00:22:39,100 --> 00:22:41,300
You usually don't let me in your craft room.

516
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:42,785
Isn't this fun?

517
00:22:42,815 --> 00:22:44,285
And challenging.

518
00:22:44,315 --> 00:22:46,085
Every Wednesday, we're gonna have puzzle night.

519
00:22:46,115 --> 00:22:49,400
Because I know how important it is for you to have a creative outlet.

520
00:22:52,900 --> 00:22:54,900
You know, the kids have been working so hard.

521
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:57,685
I was thinking about taking them on a field trip next Saturday.

522
00:22:57,715 --> 00:22:59,585
Carmel High's performing a showcase down in Akron.

523
00:22:59,615 --> 00:23:02,585
Now, Carmel's gonna be the team to beat at regionals.

524
00:23:02,615 --> 00:23:03,285
And I was wondering

525
00:23:03,315 --> 00:23:05,885 if you might want to come chaperone it with me.

526
00:23:05,915 --> 00:23:07,085
On Saturday?

527
