I had to pick up an extra shift at work, Will.

529
00:23:11,615 --> 00:23:13,385
We're living paycheck to paycheck, you know.

530
00:23:13,415 --> 00:23:16,600
And how much of that paycheck goes to your Pottery Barn credit card.

531
