I don't know what you're talking about.

532
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:21,685
Don't go in the Christmas closet!

533
00:23:21,715 --> 00:23:23,600
I was looking for my jacket the other day.

534
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,685
We cannot afford this stuff,
Terri.

535
00:23:26,715 --> 00:23:28,685
Oh, we could, Will.

536
00:23:28,715 --> 00:23:32,385
Yes, I am a shoo-in to be promoted during the Christmas week at Sheets 'N Things.

537
00:23:32,415 --> 00:23:36,185
You know, I reek of management potential, and they're hiring at H.W. Menken.

538
00:23:36,215 --> 00:23:38,085
My passion is teaching, Terri.

539
00:23:38,115 --> 00:23:39,985
For the last time, I don't want to be an accountant.

540
00:23:40,015 --> 00:23:41,885
Dr. Phil said that people could change.

541
00:23:41,915 --> 00:23:43,485
You know, it's not a bad thing

542
00:23:43,515 --> 00:23:47,200 to want a real life, Will, and to have a glue gun that works!

543
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:54,385
You know, it's really hard for me not having the things that I need

544
00:23:54,415 --> 00:23:57,785
Oh! And you need three mahogany toilet brush holders?!

545
00:23:57,815 --> 00:23:59,500
They're Balinese!

546
00:24:00,700 --> 00:24:04,700
It is not a bad thing to want things, Will.

547
00:24:05,700 --> 00:24:08,385
You know, I understand your interest in these kids, Will.

548
00:24:08,415 --> 00:24:09,985
I really do.

549
00:24:10,015 --> 00:24:11,185
Yeah.

550
00:24:11,215 --> 00:24:14,800
It's your way of recapturing your glory days.

551
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,885
But I'm not the high school cheerleader anymore,

552
00:24:16,915 --> 00:24:18,485 and you are not the golden boy.

553
00:24:18,515 --> 00:24:21,800
High school's over... for both of us.

554
00:24:23,300 --> 00:24:25,800
It's time that you move on.

555
00:25:11,300 --> 00:25:13,385
You're the quarterback.

556
00:25:13,415 --> 00:25:14,885
No. I don't want to hear it.

557
00:25:14,915 --> 00:25:15,985
You make your decision.

558
00:25:16,015 --> 00:25:19,100
You're a football player, or you're a singer.

559
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:23,285
Hey. What's going on?

560
00:25:23,315 --> 00:25:26,185
Oh. I just... I have to miss practice Saturday afternoon.

561
00:25:26,215 --> 00:25:27,485
It's, uh... it's my mom.

562
00:25:27,515 --> 00:25:30,785
I got to help her... cook and, uh, do things.

563
00:25:30,815 --> 00:25:32,000
Why?

564
00:25:32,300 --> 00:25:34,585
She just had, uh, surgery.

565
00:25:34,615 --> 00:25:36,000
